{"id":"马克","type":"character","type_label":"人物","name":"马克","aliases":["小夜"],"warnings":[],"status":"approved","available_eras":["mainline","afterstory"],"static_profile":"马克是自由都市时期「黄金三人组」的情报中枢，也是触手族研究员。他在「海拉事件」中推动了雷恩与赛琳的接触，帝国事件平息后转入技术领域，编入阿卡的科研序列。","era_states":{"mainline":"马克是自由都市时期「黄金三人组」的情报中枢，为雷恩与迪的武力提供信息优势。\n基于与海拉势力的历史渊源，马克在「海拉事件」中操控了雷恩与赛琳的接触轨迹，是这对关系确立背后的推手。\n帝国事件平息后，马克将解析能力从情报领域迁移至技术领域，编入阿卡的科研序列，成为解构神性技术的关键人员。\n马克网名「小夜」，海拉时期与赛琳、少爷组线上游戏战队。他玩世不恭但正事靠谱，与队长共同判断只有雷恩能接住赛琳，将她托付给雷恩。\n冷静、理性、条理清晰；与雷恩合谋在柯赛特、菲亚的项圈中植入定位芯片；全程提供战术支援（定位、通讯、护盾频率分析、拆锁指导）。\n冷静；科研导向；培养池触手样本暴走；提供微型战术工具盒（定位器/开锁工具）；识别空间干涉装置。\n吐槽役，对雷恩的绰号回嘴；心疼财物，怕打坏波斯地毯；在撤退敌人身上留追踪器，锁定其据点坐标；与阿卡、莉卡一起做实验；两天不眠调试诱捕装置。\n隐藏身份、不公开科研成果；海拉事件后科研水平突飞猛进，拥有自己的实验室。\n平时会咆哮、唠叨；但涉及正事时声音瞬间切回冷酷、高效、不带感情的工作模式；在帝国布局情报网，派莉卡前来鉴定艾琳娜。\n黑客，自认「没网的地方就是个废物」；与莉卡共同研制紊乱器；莉卡成为其全职助手；对瓦利诺一无所知（无公共网络）。\n原本是懒散的「快乐废物」死宅；被阿卡改为「神力应用技术开发局」，每天工作18小时研究将海拉遗产转化为可量产神力产品。\n会调侃怀旧；加入「弑神者」敢死队；分析星神之塔是一场与时间的赛跑。\n坏笑、爱起哄。","afterstory":"技术宅；破译异界通讯。\n技术宅、研究狂人；冷静分析；嫌弃被抱、保持距离；作为技术支持参与希尔世界考察；建造无人机编队、侦察卫星、防护罩等。"},"facts":[{"fact_id":"fact_00735","statement":"马克是「黄金三人组」的情报中枢，为雷恩与迪提供信息优势。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目75（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00736","statement":"马克在「海拉事件」中操控了雷恩与赛琳的接触轨迹，是二人关系确立的推手。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目75（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00737","statement":"帝国事件平息后，马克编入阿卡的科研序列，成为解构神性技术的关键人员。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「帝国事件之后」起","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目75（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00738","statement":"马克是触手族研究员，曾以莉卡为观察对象。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「主线开端」起","visibility":null,"source":"图鉴条目74（主要角色篇）"},{"fact_id":"fact_00739","statement":"马克网名ID「小夜」，海拉时期与赛琳、少爷组线上游戏战队。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第12章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00740","statement":"马克玩世不恭、爱开玩笑八卦，但谈正事时转为严肃。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第12章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00741","statement":"马克不吸烟。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第13章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00742","statement":"马克拥有高级检查设备，负责把观察报告加密发给「少爷」和迪老板。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「主线开端」起","visibility":null,"source":"第14章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00743","statement":"马克与队长共同判断只有雷恩能接住赛琳，将「珍宝」托付给雷恩。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「海拉事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第13章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00744","statement":"马克最近一直与少爷（菲尔）调查海拉之事，安排莉卡到咖啡厅二楼调查罗塞事件。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「海拉事件之后」起","visibility":null,"source":"第26章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00745","statement":"马克与莉卡是网上认识，两人一直研究触手、交换情报。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「主线开端」起","visibility":null,"source":"第26章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00746","statement":"与雷恩合谋在柯赛特和菲亚的定制项圈中植入军用级定位芯片，并称“虽然不道德但很有用”","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第37章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00747","statement":"全程提供战术支援：定位坐标（精度小于一米）、通讯、护盾频率分析、机械锁拆除指导","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「帝国事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"第37章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00748","statement":"冷静理性、条理清晰、语速极快","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第38章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00749","statement":"冷静（'马克的冷静声音传来'）","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位48"},{"fact_id":"fact_00750","statement":"科研导向，被'宇宙中有很多世界'的概念冲击科研观","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"第42章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00751","statement":"培养池触手样本疯狂暴走","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「立方体调查与触手基地行动」","visibility":null,"source":"第46章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00752","statement":"提供微型战术工具盒（含定位器与开锁工具）给雷恩","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第47章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00753","statement":"一眼识别出空间干涉装置","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"第47章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00754","statement":"被雷恩戏称「追踪器狂魔」","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「星神之塔事件之后」","visibility":null,"source":"第55章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00755","statement":"操控装置功率；重力锚索由莉卡发射","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「阿卡破开海拉防御」","visibility":null,"source":"第60章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00756","statement":"马克海拉事件后科研水平突飞猛进，拥有自己的实验室","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「海拉事件之后」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位67"},{"fact_id":"fact_00757","statement":"马克不公开科研成果、隐藏身份，助手只有莉卡一人","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「帝国事件之后」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位67"},{"fact_id":"fact_00758","statement":"马克与莉卡对维尔汀数据和菲尔情报进行交叉比对","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「海拉事件之后」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位62"},{"fact_id":"fact_00759","statement":"马克因雷恩没死却不联系、偷偷和赛琳度蜜月，在电话里咆哮十分钟","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「神战数月后的双婚礼」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位77"},{"fact_id":"fact_00760","statement":"马克听到凯瑟琳还活着的消息后，声音瞬间切回冷酷、高效、不带感情的工作模式","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位77"},{"fact_id":"fact_00761","statement":"马克在帝国布局情报网，派莉卡前来协助","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「帝国事件期间」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位77"},{"fact_id":"fact_00762","statement":"马克与莉卡特别研制了紊乱器（雷恩给赛琳、注入皇帝体内的装置）","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「帝国事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位84"},{"fact_id":"fact_00763","statement":"莉卡成为马克的全职助手","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「帝国事件之后」起","visibility":null,"source":"第88章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00764","statement":"马克表示瓦利诺没有公共网络，「再怎么样也只是个黑客而已，在没网的地方就是个废物」","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位90"},{"fact_id":"fact_00765","statement":"被雷恩称为「本来是个快乐的废物」的死宅","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位100"},{"fact_id":"fact_00766","statement":"在阿卡主持下每天工作18小时研究海拉遗产的神力量产","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"自「帝国事件之后」起","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位100"},{"fact_id":"fact_00767","statement":"马克调侃「我们三个一起已经是多久前的事了」，与雷恩、迪重逢","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「星神之塔事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位108"},{"fact_id":"fact_00768","statement":"马克分析：希尔派拖延时间，必须在倒计时结束前冲进星神之塔","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「星神之塔事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位110"},{"fact_id":"fact_00769","statement":"通过通讯怒吼提示雷恩侧翼快顶不住","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「星神之塔事件期间」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位112"},{"fact_id":"fact_00770","statement":"坏笑着向宾客解释「闹洞房」是给新人增加难度的神秘仪式","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"mainline","era_label":"主线","time":"于「神战数月后的双婚礼」","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位116"},{"fact_id":"fact_00771","statement":"马克是科研组成员，并以科学家身份参与研究。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位118"},{"fact_id":"fact_01853","statement":"马克是黑客。","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"时代：","visibility":null,"source":"原作顺序位119"},{"fact_id":"fact_00772","statement":"马克看到莉卡金属身体陷入狂热","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「工房都市初建阶段」","visibility":null,"source":"第118章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00773","statement":"马克破译异界发来的通讯文件","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「双星首次联络与互访评估」","visibility":null,"source":"第119章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00774","statement":"马克被雷恩抓壮丁，怨念「我还有三个实验没做完」","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「双星首次联络与互访评估」","visibility":null,"source":"第124章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00775","statement":"马克分析血雨成分是普通的神力紊乱，展开小型频率中和力场（防护罩）","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「双星首次联络与互访评估」","visibility":null,"source":"第124章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00776","statement":"马克放出上百架无人机群，射金色光束瞬间气化怪物","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「双星首次联络与互访评估」","visibility":null,"source":"第124章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00777","statement":"马克拒绝雷恩拥抱，说「别恶心我，离我远点」","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「双星首次联络与互访评估」","visibility":null,"source":"第124章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00778","statement":"马克将秽雨提纯转化为神力能源，无人机活动半径扩展到整个村庄","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"自「双星首次联络与互访评估」起","visibility":null,"source":"第125章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00779","statement":"马克发射低轨道侦察卫星「开全图」，造无限子弹模块、能量盾发生器、神力轰炸炮","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「双星首次联络与互访评估」","visibility":null,"source":"第125章"},{"fact_id":"fact_00780","statement":"马克语言不通时调卫星语音样本做翻译器","certainty":"canon","certainty_label":"原文明确","era":"afterstory","era_label":"后日谈","time":"于「双星首次联络与互访评估」","visibility":null,"source":"第125章"}],"relations":[{"id":"rel_0029","type":"belongs_to","from":"马克","to":"科研组","role":"成员","era_scope":["afterstory"],"source":"图鉴条目75（马克）","status":"approved","revised_by":"D-1185","relation_kind":"membership.member_of","_direction":"out","_other":"科研组（科研组）"},{"id":"rel_0093","type":"related_to","from":"雷恩","to":"马克","role":"老搭档","era_scope":["mainline"],"source":"1.4.6 迁移 + 作者裁决 2026-08-13","status":"approved","revised_by":"D-2381","relation_kind":"social.teammate","effective_from":"tp_mainline_start","_direction":"in","_other":"雷恩（雷恩）"},{"id":"rel_0115","type":"related_to","from":"马克","to":"莉卡","role":"恋人","era_scope":["mainline","afterstory"],"source":"1.4.6 迁移 + 作者裁决 2026-08-13","status":"approved","revised_by":"D-4138","relation_kind":"social.partner","effective_from":"tp_mainline_empire_after","_direction":"out","_other":"莉卡（莉卡）"},{"id":"rel_0116","type":"related_to","from":"马克","to":"阿卡","role":"科研同僚","era_scope":["mainline","afterstory"],"source":"1.4.6 迁移 + 作者裁决 2026-08-13","status":"approved","revised_by":"D-1297","relation_kind":"social.teammate","_direction":"out","_other":"阿卡（阿卡）"},{"id":"rel_0119","type":"related_to","from":"玛琪娜","to":"马克","role":"科研组同僚","era_scope":["afterstory"],"source":"1.4.6 迁移 + 作者裁决 2026-08-13","status":"approved","revised_by":"D-1299","relation_kind":"social.teammate","_direction":"in","_other":"玛琪娜（玛琪娜）"},{"id":"rel_0122","type":"related_to","from":"迪","to":"马克","role":"搭档","era_scope":["mainline"],"source":"1.4.6 迁移 + 作者裁决 2026-08-13","status":"approved","revised_by":"D-1300","relation_kind":"social.teammate","_direction":"in","_other":"迪（迪）"}],"source":"图鉴条目75（主要角色篇）","revised_by":"D-4442"}
